{title: 34 En momentos así}
{key: D}
{time: 3/4}
{lyricist: David Graham (1948-; Vers. esp.: Anónimo}
{composer: David Graham (1948-}

{sov}
En [D]momentos así [Bm]yo [Em]canto canción,[A]
[Em]canción de [A]amor a mi [D]Cristo.[A]
En [D]momentos así [Bm]yo [Em]busco al Señor,[A]
[Em]elevo [A]mi alma a [D]Dios.
[G]Hoy [A]te adoro, [D]Señor,
[G]y [A]te alabo, mi [D]Dios;
[G]Y te [A]amo, [Bm]mi [G]Jesús, [D]te [A]amo, mi [D]Señor.
{eov}
